    "detailed_description": "\u3010Game description\u3011<br>There is no such thing as a story.<br>In a world erosion by monsters, I, a villager, will stand up!<br>You can use money to increase fellow, strengthen equipment, and buy houses.<br>Organize your life, defeat monsters with your fellow, and explore the vast world!<br><br>{STEAM_APP_IMAGE}/explanation1.jpg<br>\u3010How to proceed with the game\u3011<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2770230/extras/335afa318dbd3de6bd77b638224b8d2e.avif?t=1708084331\" width=512 height=280 /></span><br>Players become adventurers who defeat monsters that live in various environments, earn money, and improve the life around them.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2770230/extras/33fd224dcb34f41b8395a9e738853acb.avif?t=1708084331\" width=512 height=280 /></span><br>There are limits to the power of one person alone. You can hire adventurers in town, increase your number of fellow, give instructions to your fellow, and defeat monsters together. *You can add up to 10 fellow.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2770230/extras/560bd503cecdb1ddaf48261b88707b18.avif?t=1708084331\" width=512 height=270 /></span><br>Money can be used in a variety of ways, including hiring adventurers, strengthening equipment, unlocking skills, and using shops.<br>Let's go on an adventure!<br><br><br>\u3010perspective\u3011<br>3rd person view only.<br><br>\u3010Method of operation\u3011<br>Keyboard + mouse only.<br>\u3010Player operation\u3011<br>\u30fb[Tab] Item column.<br>\u30fb[M]Map.<br>\u30fb[Left mouse click] action.<br>\u3010Moving method\u3011<br>\u30fbMove the player using the [W][A][S][D] keys.<br>\u30fbMove the player's viewpoint using [mouse operation].<br>\u30fbUse the [mouse wheel] to zoom or zoom out.<br>\u30fb[Shift long press] Dash.<br>\u3010Give instructions to your Friend\u3011<br>\u30fbPress the [Q] button to switch palettes \u2192 switch members.<br>\u30fbSelect members using keys [0] to [9].<br>\u30fb[Right mouse click] Select all allies.<br>\u30fb[Mouse wheel click] Deselect all allies.<br>\u30fb[Left mouse click] Moves the allies to the specified position.<br>\u30fb[R] Instructions to run to friends.<br>\u30fb[F] Move all allies to the formation position (You can specify the position of the [Member] formation from the inventory by pressing the [Tab] key.)",
    "about_the_game": "\u3010Game description\u3011<br>There is no such thing as a story.<br>In a world erosion by monsters, I, a villager, will stand up!<br>You can use money to increase fellow, strengthen equipment, and buy houses.<br>Organize your life, defeat monsters with your fellow, and explore the vast world!<br><br>{STEAM_APP_IMAGE}/explanation1.jpg<br>\u3010How to proceed with the game\u3011<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2770230/extras/335afa318dbd3de6bd77b638224b8d2e.avif?t=1708084331\" width=512 height=280 /></span><br>Players become adventurers who defeat monsters that live in various environments, earn money, and improve the life around them.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2770230/extras/33fd224dcb34f41b8395a9e738853acb.avif?t=1708084331\" width=512 height=280 /></span><br>There are limits to the power of one person alone. You can hire adventurers in town, increase your number of fellow, give instructions to your fellow, and defeat monsters together. *You can add up to 10 fellow.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2770230/extras/560bd503cecdb1ddaf48261b88707b18.avif?t=1708084331\" width=512 height=270 /></span><br>Money can be used in a variety of ways, including hiring adventurers, strengthening equipment, unlocking skills, and using shops.<br>Let's go on an adventure!<br><br><br>\u3010perspective\u3011<br>3rd person view only.<br><br>\u3010Method of operation\u3011<br>Keyboard + mouse only.<br>\u3010Player operation\u3011<br>\u30fb[Tab] Item column.<br>\u30fb[M]Map.<br>\u30fb[Left mouse click] action.<br>\u3010Moving method\u3011<br>\u30fbMove the player using the [W][A][S][D] keys.<br>\u30fbMove the player's viewpoint using [mouse operation].<br>\u30fbUse the [mouse wheel] to zoom or zoom out.<br>\u30fb[Shift long press] Dash.<br>\u3010Give instructions to your Friend\u3011<br>\u30fbPress the [Q] button to switch palettes \u2192 switch members.<br>\u30fbSelect members using keys [0] to [9].<br>\u30fb[Right mouse click] Select all allies.<br>\u30fb[Mouse wheel click] Deselect all allies.<br>\u30fb[Left mouse click] Moves the allies to the specified position.<br>\u30fb[R] Instructions to run to friends.<br>\u30fb[F] Move all allies to the formation position (You can specify the position of the [Member] formation from the inventory by pressing the [Tab] key.)",
    "short_description": "There is no such thing as a story. In a world erosion by monsters, I, a villager, will stand up! You can use money to increase friends, strengthen equipment, and buy houses. Organize your life, defeat monsters with your fellow, and explore the vast world!",
